# Captured marketing assets. Both are reproducible from a simulator run —
# Scripts/capture-screenshots.sh and Scripts/record-demo.sh — so the captures
# themselves stay out of history rather than landing again on every re-record.
# See docs/regenerating-marketing-assets.md.
#
# The raw screen recording lands in build/, already ignored above. The published
# video under web/demo/ is deliberately NOT ignored: it is a site asset and the
# deploy serves it.
fastlane/screenshots/

# Vercel CLI local link and pulled env (vercel pull writes here)
.vercel
